   "body": "Done in #1114 (merged as 48407010d59fed517041d6e5808bcb1a04865bbd). Follow-up: #1119 (composer tests: fail when the frames never settle). Note: on the iPhone Duo simulator three more tests fail on `dev-swift` for the same reason (a regular-iPhone assumption): `ListDensityMarginsTests` (landscape margins), `AccountMenuPlacementTests`, `FavoritesUnreadFilterTests` (seen by #1115's whole-target runs at 12fdd8bf); CI runs on an iPhone 18 Pro, so they do not block it.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
